  "details": "Negative blendshape values as well as blendshape values over 100 can be very useful. These values work fine in unity, however, VRChat clamps them from 0-100. \n\nThe ability to have negative value blendshapes as well as values over 100 helps maximize customizability of an avatar in unity. Users don't have to rework a blendshape in blender if they simply wish to apply that blendshape to a higher or negative value.",
